        "message": "=Hello,\n\nThanks for getting in touch through my portfolio. {{ { role: 'I read every message about a role myself', project: 'I read every project enquiry myself' }[$json.intent] ?? 'I read every message myself' }} and will answer within two working days.\n\nMy CV is at https://portfolio.ahmed-hrichi.workers.dev/cv in the meantime.\n\nBest regards,\nAhmed Hrichi\n\n--\nThis is an automatic reply. This address was entered in the contact form at portfolio.ahmed-hrichi.workers.dev; if that wasn't you, please ignore this email.",
